# Names the prelink (tools/prelink/native_prelink.py) binds in the native kernel beyond XNU's KPI exports. A RELEASE
# kernel links with an export list (all-kpi.exp, xnu_kernel's extra_exports), and a global left off it loses N_EXT,
# which the prelink reads. DEVELOPMENT links without a list and exports every global anyway.
# emit_prelink.py CUT_STUB (drivers/SwitchUSB): the zero word a cut dependency's metaclass pointers are rebound to.
_switch_prelink_cut_null
# The ABI markers emit_prelink.py checks the native kernel for (kits/NativePrelink's XNU patches).
_kalloc_sparse_prelink_index_version
_native_prelink_security_init_version
# kits/SwitchIdle (kernel/switch/idle/idle.c) for the EMC governor (drivers/SwitchPower/SwitchEMC.cpp).
_switch_idle_last_frame
_switch_idle_set_frames_started
